WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.932
Your Level 5 learners need their own organiser for every

00:00:03.932 --> 00:00:07.450
lesson, and building those pages each week takes hours.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.162
62 printable A4 pages.

00:00:12.182 --> 00:00:16.948
It's for learners aged 14+ (CEFR B2 to C1) following Level 5

00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:19.569
Advanced with a teacher or tutor.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.020
190,000 dong per learner.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.120
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

